#: ../../extend/index.md:1
msgid "扩展开发总览"
msgstr "Extension development overview"

#: ../../extend/index.md:3
msgid ""
"sapic 的插件叫**钩子（hook）**：一个 Python 模块或包，被核心按需加载， "
"用它自己声明的清单描述界面与能力。核心不认识任何插件名，只认契约。"
msgstr ""
"Plugins in sapic are called **hooks**: a Python module or package that "
"the core loads on demand, describing its interface and capabilities in a "
"manifest it declares itself. The core knows no plugin names, only the "
"contract."

#: ../../extend/index.md:6
msgid "扩展类型"
msgstr "The five extension types"

