msgid ""
"扩展类型由 `__catalog__` 声明，契约判断集中在 `sapic/libs/ext.py` （认证流程、存储解析、后台接口都问它，不各自"
" `getattr`）："
msgstr ""
"The extension type is declared by `__catalog__`, and contract checks live"
" in `sapic/libs/ext.py` (the auth flow, storage resolution and admin APIs"
" all ask it instead of calling `getattr` themselves):"

