#: ../../extend/index.md:20
msgid ""
"清单里的 `kind` 与 `warnings` 由核心计算：`warnings` 会点明「声明了 upload 却缺 "
"`upimg_save`」这类不完整实现，后台钩子页与 `GET /api/v2/hooks` 都能看到。"
msgstr ""
"The manifest `kind` and `warnings` are computed by the core: `warnings` "
"points out incomplete implementations such as declaring `upload` without "
"`upimg_save`, and both the admin hooks page and `GET /api/v2/hooks` show "
"them."

#: ../../extend/index.md:23
msgid "加载与生效流程"
msgstr "How hooks are loaded and applied"

#: ../../extend/index.md:25
msgid ""
"**发现**：扫描包内 `server/sapic/hooks/*.py`（`family=local`）， 再按 "
"`hooks_imported` 设置里的模块名 `import`（`family=third`， 模块来自 "
"`HOOK_PKG_STORAGE_DIR` 或已安装的 site-packages）。"
msgstr ""
"**Discovery**: modules under `server/sapic/hooks/*.py` are scanned "
"(`family=local`), then the module names listed in the `hooks_imported` "
"setting are imported (`family=third`, coming from `HOOK_PKG_STORAGE_DIR` "
"or an installed site-packages)."

#: ../../extend/index.md:28
msgid "**校验元数据**：缺 `__version__` / `__author__` 的模块被跳过并记日志，不影响其它钩子。"
msgstr ""
"**Metadata check**: modules missing `__version__` / `__author__` are "
"skipped and logged without affecting other hooks."

#: ../../extend/index.md:29
msgid "**启停**：`hooks_state` 里的布尔值优先，缺省看模块自己的 `__state__`（默认启用）。"
msgstr ""
"**Enable/disable**: a boolean in `hooks_state` wins; otherwise the module"
" `__state__` applies (enabled by default)."

#: ../../extend/index.md:30
msgid ""
"**配置**：`hooks_config` 存钩子级配置，字段由 `hook_manifest()` 的 `config_schema` 声明， "
"后台钩子页据此渲染表单（`PUT /api/v2/hooks/config/<name>`）。"
msgstr ""
"**Configuration**: `hooks_config` stores per-hook config whose fields are"
" declared by `config_schema` in `hook_manifest()`, and the admin hooks "
"page renders the form from it (`PUT /api/v2/hooks/config/<name>`)."

#: ../../extend/index.md:32
msgid ""
"**调用**：认证/存储/后处理按契约进入热路径；界面块、动作、数据集按前端请求触发。 "
"处理器（`upimg_stream_processor`）还会拿到自己的 `config`（如 `pic2webp` 的 `quality`）， "
"存储驱动则通过 `backend=` 取合并后的配置。审核（`review_image`）**不在请求路径里**， 由 `flask sa "
"review-pending` 扫描时调用，见[内容审核](moderator.md)。"
msgstr "**Invocation**: auth / storage / post-processing enter the hot path "
"through their contract; interface blocks, actions and data sources are "
"triggered by front-end requests. A processor (`upimg_stream_processor`) "
"also receives its own `config` (e.g. `quality` for `pic2webp`), while a "
"storage driver gets the merged config through `backend=`. Moderation "
"(`review_image`) is **not on the request path**: the `flask sa "
"review-pending` scan calls it, see [content moderation](moderator.md)."

#: ../../extend/index.md:37
msgid ""
"钩子热重载：`POST /api/v2/hooks/reload` 立即重建快照；平时每隔 `HOOK_RELOAD_TIME` 按「源文件 "
"mtime + 已登记模块列表」决定是否换快照， 多 worker 部署下任意进程改了启停/安装列表，其它进程也会跟上。"
msgstr ""
"Hot reload: `POST /api/v2/hooks/reload` rebuilds the snapshot "
"immediately; otherwise every `HOOK_RELOAD_TIME` seconds the snapshot is "
"replaced when source mtimes or the registered module list changed, so in "
"a multi-worker deployment a change made in any process reaches the "
"others."

#: ../../extend/index.md:41
msgid "写一个最小钩子"
msgstr "Write a minimal hook"

#: ../../extend/index.md:43
msgid "先跑通再对照契约。下面是一个只有界面块的钩子（不声明 `__catalog__`，一个文件即可）："
msgstr ""
"Get it running first, then read the contract. Below is a hook with a "
"single interface block (no `__catalog__`; one file is enough):"

#: ../../extend/index.md:64
msgid "本地联调：不用打包、不用重启进程。"
msgstr "Local debugging: no packaging, no process restart."

#: ../../extend/index.md:79
msgid "钩子跑在应用进程里：日志用 `logging.getLogger(__name__)`，与后端同一个输出；`print()` 不走日志。"
msgstr ""
"Hooks run inside the application process: log with "
"`logging.getLogger(__name__)` so output goes to the same place as the "
"backend; `print()` does not reach the log."

#: ../../extend/index.md:80
msgid "写成包（`sapic_storage_s3/`）时用 `pip install -e .` 装进当前解释器，再登记模块名同样能加载。"
msgstr ""
"When you turn it into a package (`sapic_storage_s3/`), install it into "
"the running interpreter with `pip install -e .` and register the module "
"name — it loads the same way."

#: ../../extend/index.md:81
msgid "插槽会渲染在哪个页面由白名单决定（见[钩子基础契约](contract.md)），`admin.*` 开头的只对管理员渲染。"
msgstr ""
"Which page a slot renders on is decided by the allowlist (see [Hook "
"basics](contract.md)); slots starting with `admin.` only render for "
"administrators."

#: ../../extend/index.md:82
msgid "本地环境搭建、跑测试与代码风格见[开发与贡献](../dev.md)。"
msgstr ""
"Local environment, tests and code style are covered in [Development and "
"contributing](../dev.md)."

