#: ../../extend/index.md:97
msgid "安装第三方包"
msgstr "Installing third-party packages"

#: ../../extend/index.md:99
msgid "两种方式都能把包交给 sapic（打包细节见 [发布与安装](publishing.md)）："
msgstr ""
"Both routes hand the package to sapic (packaging details are in "
"[Packaging and publishing](publishing.md)):"

#: ../../extend/index.md:101
msgid ""
"**后台安装**（推荐）：`POST /api/v2/hooks/install`，等价于 `pip install --target "
"$HOOK_PKG_STORAGE_DIR <包名>`；如果包目录名与模块名不同， 再用 `POST /api/v2/hooks/import` "
"登记模块名。"
msgstr ""
"**Install from the admin** (recommended): `POST /api/v2/hooks/install`, "
"equivalent to `pip install --target $HOOK_PKG_STORAGE_DIR <package>`; if "
"the package directory name differs from the module name, register the "
"module with `POST /api/v2/hooks/import` afterwards."

#: ../../extend/index.md:104
msgid ""
"**手动安装**：把包装进 `HOOK_PKG_STORAGE_DIR`（默认 `data/hooks`，已在 `sys.path` 上）， "
"或装进解释器的 site-packages，然后登记模块名。"
msgstr ""
"**Manual install**: put the package into `HOOK_PKG_STORAGE_DIR` (default "
"`data/hooks`, already on `sys.path`) or install it into the interpreter "
"site-packages, then register the module name."

#: ../../extend/index.md:107
msgid ""
"该目录只加入 `sys.path`，**不参与扫描**：`pip install --target` 会把依赖一并丢进去， "
"按目录扫描会让无关第三方代码被当作钩子执行。"
msgstr ""
"That directory is only added to `sys.path` and is **never scanned**: `pip"
" install --target` drops dependencies in there too, and scanning it would"
" execute unrelated third-party code as hooks."

#: ../../extend/index.md:110
msgid "安全边界"
msgstr "Security boundaries"

#: ../../extend/index.md:112
msgid "安装、导入、删除、重载、读配置都是 admin 接口；钩子代码本身就是任意 Python， 没有沙箱，装之前要信任来源。"
msgstr ""
"Installing, importing, deleting, reloading and reading config are all "
"admin APIs; hook code is arbitrary Python with no sandbox, so trust the "
"source before installing."

#: ../../extend/index.md:114
msgid ""
"钩子返回的界面是**声明式 JSON**，不是 HTML/JS。节点类型、键、`href` 协议、 `action` 名、插槽名都在 "
"`libs/ui.py` 白名单里清洗，未知内容直接丢弃， 因此插件不能在前端注入脚本。"
msgstr ""
"The interface a hook returns is **declarative JSON**, not HTML/JS. Node "
"types, keys, `href` schemes, `action` names and slot names are all "
"sanitised against the `libs/ui.py` allowlist and unknown content is "
"dropped, so a plugin cannot inject scripts into the front end."

#: ../../extend/index.md:117
msgid "动作的 `scope` 由清单声明，`admin` 动作只有管理员能触发；数据源接口本身要求管理员。"
msgstr ""
"An action `scope` is declared in the manifest and `admin` actions can "
"only be triggered by administrators; data source endpoints require an "
"administrator as well."

#: ../../extend/index.md:118
msgid ""
"驱动拿到的配置由核心合并（钩子级默认值 + 后端行配置 + 运行时 `root`）， 驱动不能决定图片可见性、优先级或过期策略，那些留在 "
"`libs/storage.py`。"
msgstr ""
"Driver config is merged by the core (hook defaults + backend row config +"
" the runtime `root`); a driver cannot decide image visibility, priority "
"or expiry policy — those stay in `libs/storage.py`."

